- selling, renting or making money with Bamboo
- using Bamboo's name, logo, graphics, cosmetics or music, including under another name
- presenting Bamboo as your own work or removing rights notices

4. Violations
Any use beyond point 2 without written permission infringes the developers' rights. The developers reserve
the right to take legal action (for example cease-and-desist, injunction, damages) and to have copies
removed. The permission in point 2 ends automatically on any violation.

5. No warranty
Bamboo is provided free of charge and as is, without warranty. To the extent permitted by law, the
developers are not liable for damage caused by its use. Statutory liability for intent and gross
negligence remains unaffected.

6. Third-party parts
Fonts and other third-party parts keep their own licences. Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang AB /
